; tags_verify_precedence.journal
; Independent compat-differential-tester fixture (re-verifying
; LK-COMPAT-QUERY-TAG-INHERIT-001, LK-COMPAT-QUERY-TAG-COMMODITY-001, and
; LK-COMPAT-QUERY-TAG-ACCOUNTS-001) -- NOT derived from the implementing
; session's own tests/fixtures/tags.journal (different account names, tag
; names, and an added three-level grandchild-account case the original
; fixture did not cover).
;
; "lvl" is declared with a DIFFERENT value at each of the four effective-tag
; sources, on the SAME posting (2024-04-01's assets:cash posting), to test
; the no-shadowing/union claim directly:
;   posting-own (2024-04-01 assets:cash posting)         lvl:10
;   commodity-propagated ($)                              lvl:20
;   account-inherited (assets:cash, incl. all descendants) lvl:30
;   transaction-header (2024-04-01's txn)                  lvl:40
;   posting-own, sibling txn, same account                 lvl:50 (2024-04-05)
;
; "owner" is declared once per source (transaction/account/commodity) with a
; distinct value, for the accounts four-way-visibility split.
;
; assets:cash:till:jar is a THREE-level-deep account, never itself declared
; via an `account` directive, to test that account-tag inheritance walks the
; full ancestor chain (not just the direct parent).

account assets:cash  ; lvl:30, owner:acct
    ; more:stuff

account assets:cash:till

commodity $  ; lvl:20, owner:commodity

2024-04-01 Header transaction  ; lvl:40, owner:txn
    assets:cash                $100.00  ; lvl:10, owner:posting
    equity:opening             $-100.00

2024-04-05 Sibling same account, different posting-own value, no header tag
    assets:cash                 $15.00  ; lvl:50
    equity:opening              $-15.00

2024-04-10 Direct child account, no own tags at all
    assets:cash:till              $7.00
    equity:opening                $-7.00

2024-04-15 Commodity-only posting, account with no declared account-level tag
    expenses:other                $9.00
    equity:opening                $-9.00

2024-04-20 Grandchild account three levels down, never declared
    assets:cash:till:jar           $3.00
    equity:opening                 $-3.00
